<BaseLayout {title} {description} lang="en"><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Professional profile</p><h1>Architecture with technical depth.</h1><p class="lead">I am a Software Architect and IT Engineer. For more than two decades I have designed, integrated and evolved systems supporting real operations across retail, logistics, financial services and insurance.</p></section><section><p class="eyebrow">Approach</p><h2>Understand before designing.</h2><div class="split"><div class="panel"><h3>Technology + business</h3><p>My work starts by understanding the process, constraints and expected impact. Architecture is a tool to organize decisions and enable evolution — not an end in itself.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Design + execution</h3><p>I stay close to implementation, moving from architecture and domain modeling into APIs, backend, data, integration and cloud when the problem requires technical depth.</p></div></div></section><section><p class="eyebrow">Career</p><h2>From enterprise platforms to SaaS products.</h2><p class="lead">My experience spans early digital transformation initiatives in insurance and financial services, business intelligence, critical retail and logistics systems, e-commerce and ERP/WMS integration, and a multi-tenant B2B SaaS product designed from scratch.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/en/">← Back home</a></div></section></BaseLayout>